Eight-symbol adaptation: a Lean proof of S(8) >= 46,130.
The following upstream NOTICE is retained verbatim for attribution and licensing.
Its references to seven-symbol files and construction data describe the upstream
project; that construction data is not included in this standalone repository.
See PORTING.md for the new contribution and exact source revisions.

Superperm7 — a Lean 4 proof that 5898 <= s(7) <= 5906 for superpermutations on seven symbols
(https://github.com/jlebar/superperm7-ge-5898)
